#: ../../technical/topics/modelo-work-and-revision-lifecycle-part-1.md:10
msgid ""
"The [full topic synthesis](modelo-work-and-revision-lifecycle-part-1.md) "
"tracks work-unit calculation, edit, verification, local export, local "
"filing, external-evidence reconciliation and amendment. A registry-pinned"
" source mesh combines profile, ledger, invoices, withholding and prior "
"declarations into a content-addressed BORRADOR revision. Verification "
"checks filing-grade authority, source completeness, ledger drift and "
"model-specific evidence. Local export writes an artifact; local filing "
"creates a PRESENTADO revision whose AEAT status remains pending. External"
" receipt/register matching is the separate promotion path; an amendment "
"again starts as a pending local correction. Calculation "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/calculation_actions.py`) Verification "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/verification_actions.py`) Local filing "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/revision_persistence.py`) Reconciliation"
" (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/filing_chain_reconciliation.py`) "
"([067](../articles/067-modelo-calculation-preparation-edits-and-evidence-"
"gates.md), [069](../articles/069-aggregation-operations-amendments-and-"
"profile-bindings.md), [070](../articles/070-modelo-calculation-input-and-"
"persistence-orchestration.md), [074](../articles/074-external-filing-"
"evidence-local-filing-and-filing-views.md), [078](../articles/078"
"-supervised-filing-lifecycle-and-operation-contracts.md), "
"[082](../articles/082-review-package-exchange-and-modelo-revision-"
"persistence.md), [083](../articles/083-revision-selection-settlement-"
"presentation-and-verification.md))"
msgstr ""
"La [síntesis completa del tema](modelo-work-and-revision-lifecycle-"
"part-1.md) sigue el cálculo de unidades de trabajo, edición, "
"verificación, exportación local, presentación local, conciliación de "
"evidencias externas y rectificación. Una malla de fuentes con registro "
"fijado combina perfil, libro contable, facturas, retenciones y "
"declaraciones previas en una revisión BORRADOR direccionada por "
"contenido. La verificación comprueba autoridad apta para declaración, "
"integridad de fuentes, divergencias del libro contable y evidencias "
"específicas del modelo. La exportación local escribe un artefacto; la "
"presentación local crea una revisión PRESENTADO cuyo estado ante la AEAT "
"sigue pendiente. La coincidencia con justificantes o registros externos "
"es la ruta separada de promoción; una rectificación vuelve a comenzar "
"como corrección local pendiente. Cálculo "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/calculation_actions.py`) Verificación "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/verification_actions.py`) Presentación "
"local (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/revision_persistence.py`) "
"Conciliación "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/filing_chain_reconciliation.py`) "
"([067](../articles/067-modelo-calculation-preparation-edits-and-evidence-"
"gates.md), [069](../articles/069-aggregation-operations-amendments-and-"
"profile-bindings.md), [070](../articles/070-modelo-calculation-input-and-"
"persistence-orchestration.md), [074](../articles/074-external-filing-"
"evidence-local-filing-and-filing-views.md), [078](../articles/078"
"-supervised-filing-lifecycle-and-operation-contracts.md), "
"[082](../articles/082-review-package-exchange-and-modelo-revision-"
"persistence.md), [083](../articles/083-revision-selection-settlement-"
"presentation-and-verification.md))"

#: ../../technical/topics/modelo-work-and-revision-lifecycle-part-1.md:12
msgid ""
"The stage gates preserve source/override precedence, typed provenance, "
"registry revision identity and exact profile/period authority. An edit "
"baseline is short-lived and value-free; active execution supports "
"scalar/binding edits while refusing row intents. M123 with captured "
"withholding refuses calculation through export pending a settled count "
"rule; M193 prior-accrual settlement has a later filing/export refusal. "
"M036 records and operator observations are local assertions; M145 is a "
"payer communication, with filing/submission links explicitly refused. "
"Report PDF signatures are pinned to a profile key only when store "
"verification succeeds, and expressly do not claim AEAT status. Edit "
"admission (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/edit_admission.py`) M123 gate "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/m123_count_authority_gate.py`) M145 "
"ownership (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/m145_communication.py`) Report"
" verification "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/calculation_report_verification.py`) "
"([071](../articles/071-calculation-findings-reports-and-pdf-"
"verification.md), [072](../articles/072-declaration-projections-help-"
"dependencies-and-edit-admission.md), [073](../articles/073-edit-value-"
"contracts-and-modelo-export.md), [075](../articles/075-modelo-history-"
"invoice-withholding-capture-and-iva-wallet.md), [076](../articles/076"
"-local-observations-m036-records-and-m145-communications.md), "
"[077](../articles/077-tax-evidence-private-previews-and-spreadsheet-"
"operations.md), [079](../articles/079-profile-derived-bindings-and-"
"filing-readiness.md))"
msgstr ""
"Los controles de etapas conservan precedencia de fuentes y sustituciones,"
" procedencia tipada, identidad de revisión del registro y autoridad "
"exacta de perfil y período. Una base de edición es de corta duración y no"
" contiene valores; la ejecución activa admite ediciones escalares y de "
"vinculaciones y rechaza intenciones de filas. M123 con retenciones "
"capturadas rechaza desde el cálculo hasta la exportación mientras se "
"resuelve una regla de recuento; la liquidación de devengos anteriores de "
"M193 tiene un rechazo posterior de presentación y exportación. Los "
"registros M036 y las observaciones del operador son afirmaciones locales;"
" M145 es una comunicación al pagador, con vínculos de declaración y "
"presentación expresamente rechazados. Las firmas de informes PDF se fijan"
" a una clave del perfil solo cuando la verificación del almacén tiene "
"éxito y expresamente no afirman estado ante la AEAT. Admisión de "
"ediciones (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/edit_admission.py`) Control "
"M123 (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/m123_count_authority_gate.py`) "
"Titularidad M145 (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/m145_communication.py`)"
" Verificación de informes "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/calculation_report_verification.py`) "
"([071](../articles/071-calculation-findings-reports-and-pdf-"
"verification.md), [072](../articles/072-declaration-projections-help-"
"dependencies-and-edit-admission.md), [073](../articles/073-edit-value-"
"contracts-and-modelo-export.md), [075](../articles/075-modelo-history-"
"invoice-withholding-capture-and-iva-wallet.md), [076](../articles/076"
"-local-observations-m036-records-and-m145-communications.md), "
"[077](../articles/077-tax-evidence-private-previews-and-spreadsheet-"
"operations.md), [079](../articles/079-profile-derived-bindings-and-"
"filing-readiness.md))"

#: ../../technical/topics/modelo-work-and-revision-lifecycle-part-1.md:14
msgid ""
"Scoped concerns include calculation advisories running after revision "
"persistence, export event recording before file publication, verification"
" report and revision writes in separate steps, sticky wallet overrides, "
"helpers that reopen default authority rather than reuse a pin, and "
"feedback import without visible replay-nonce consumption. The accountant "
"package uses member hashes, signatures and recipient encryption, but "
"trust in a recipient key still needs out-of-band checking. Quickfile ends"
" at local export; M100-from-M130 projection is explicitly an estimate. "
"Post-persist work "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/calculation_actions.py`) Export sequence"
" (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/export.py`) Feedback route "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/review_package_exchange_operation.py`) "
"([068](../articles/068-modelo-reconciliation-advisories-and-work-"
"projections.md), [080](../articles/080-modelo-projections-queries-"
"quickfile-and-recipient-encryption.md), [081](../articles/081"
"-reconciliation-filing-disposition-and-accountant-review-packages.md))"
msgstr ""
"Las preocupaciones acotadas incluyen avisos de cálculo ejecutados después"
" de persistir la revisión, registro del evento de exportación antes de "
"publicar el archivo, escrituras separadas de informe de verificación y "
"revisión, sustituciones persistentes de cartera, utilidades que reabren "
"autoridad predeterminada en lugar de reutilizar una fijación e "
"importación de comentarios sin consumo visible del nonce de repetición. "
"El paquete para el contable utiliza hashes de miembros, firmas y cifrado "
"para el destinatario, pero la confianza en la clave del destinatario "
"sigue necesitando comprobación por otro canal. Quickfile termina en "
"exportación local; la proyección de M100 desde M130 es expresamente una "
"estimación. Trabajo posterior a persistencia "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/calculation_actions.py`) Secuencia de "
"exportación (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/export.py`) Ruta de "
"comentarios "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/review_package_exchange_operation.py`) "
"([068](../articles/068-modelo-reconciliation-advisories-and-work-"
"projections.md), [080](../articles/080-modelo-projections-queries-"
"quickfile-and-recipient-encryption.md), [081](../articles/081"
"-reconciliation-filing-disposition-and-accountant-review-packages.md))"

#: ../../technical/topics/modelo-work-and-revision-lifecycle-part-1.md:20
msgid ""
"This part follows a declaration from profile-bound work unit through "
"calculation, review, verification, local export, local filing, external "
"evidence reconciliation, and amendment. The stages have distinct "
"authority: a calculated draft records a result, a verified revision is "
"filing grade under local checks, an export is a local artifact, a local "
"filing record remains pending AEAT confirmation, and an external receipt "
"or register observation can later support reconciliation. The application"
" registers operations around these existing service authorities, "
"generally binding exact profile, selected period, revision and operation "
"receipt. Calculation action "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/calculation_actions.py`) Verification "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/verification_actions.py`) Local filing "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/filing_actions.py`) "
"([067](../articles/067-modelo-calculation-preparation-edits-and-evidence-"
"gates.md), [070](../articles/070-modelo-calculation-input-and-"
"persistence-orchestration.md), [074](../articles/074-external-filing-"
"evidence-local-filing-and-filing-views.md), [078](../articles/078"
"-supervised-filing-lifecycle-and-operation-contracts.md), "
"[083](../articles/083-revision-selection-settlement-presentation-and-"
"verification.md))"
msgstr ""
"Esta parte sigue una declaración desde una unidad de trabajo vinculada al"
" perfil hasta cálculo, revisión, verificación, exportación local, "
"presentación local, conciliación de evidencias externas y rectificación. "
"Las etapas tienen autoridad distinta: un borrador calculado registra un "
"resultado, una revisión verificada es apta para declaración según "
"controles locales, una exportación es un artefacto local, un registro "
"local de presentación sigue pendiente de confirmación de la AEAT y un "
"justificante externo u observación de registro puede respaldar después la"
" conciliación. La aplicación registra operaciones alrededor de estas "
"autoridades de servicio existentes, vinculando generalmente perfil "
"exacto, período seleccionado, revisión y recibo de operación. Acción de "
"cálculo (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/calculation_actions.py`) "
"Verificación (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/verification_actions.py`) "
"Presentación local (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/filing_actions.py`) "
"([067](../articles/067-modelo-calculation-preparation-edits-and-evidence-"
"gates.md), [070](../articles/070-modelo-calculation-input-and-"
"persistence-orchestration.md), [074](../articles/074-external-filing-"
"evidence-local-filing-and-filing-views.md), [078](../articles/078"
"-supervised-filing-lifecycle-and-operation-contracts.md), "
"[083](../articles/083-revision-selection-settlement-presentation-and-"
"verification.md))"

#: ../../technical/topics/modelo-work-and-revision-lifecycle-part-1.md:22
msgid "Calculation and work inspection"
msgstr "Inspección de cálculos y trabajos"

#: ../../technical/topics/modelo-work-and-revision-lifecycle-part-1.md:24
msgid ""
"Calculation preparation chooses an active work unit and law-selected, "
"pinned registry snapshot; it validates canonical casilla and binding "
"channels, detail rows, profile readiness, source-sensitive ledger "
"preflight, and for Modelo 303 an IVA-wallet decision. The source mesh "
"composes ledger IVA/Renta, invoices, withholding, inventory, foreign "
"assets, prior filings, relations and model-specific sources. Ownership "
"rules reject competing source values; caller overrides are limited to "
"declared carry/manual policy. The formula engine emits typed observations"
" with operands, legal/source references and an operator-layer replay "
"payload, then persists a content-addressed BORRADOR revision and ledger "
"fact anchor. Registry route tables check that executable resolvers are "
"enrolled once. This produces a calculation, not an export or filing. "
"Preparation "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/_calculation_preparation.py`) Input "
"routing (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/calculate_input.py`) Mesh "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/calculation_actions.py`) Route ownership"
" (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/calculation_route.py`) Revision "
"persistence (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/revision_persistence.py`) "
"([067](../articles/067-modelo-calculation-preparation-edits-and-evidence-"
"gates.md), [070](../articles/070-modelo-calculation-input-and-"
"persistence-orchestration.md), [071](../articles/071-calculation-"
"findings-reports-and-pdf-verification.md), [082](../articles/082-review-"
"package-exchange-and-modelo-revision-persistence.md))"
msgstr ""
"La preparación del cálculo elige una unidad de trabajo activa y una "
"instantánea fijada del registro seleccionada según la ley; valida canales"
" canónicos de casillas y vinculaciones, filas de detalle, preparación del"
" perfil, comprobación previa del libro contable sensible a las fuentes y,"
" para el Modelo 303, una decisión de cartera de IVA. La malla de fuentes "
"compone IVA y Renta del libro contable, facturas, retenciones, "
"inventario, activos extranjeros, declaraciones previas, relaciones y "
"fuentes específicas del modelo. Las reglas de titularidad rechazan "
"valores de fuentes en competencia; las sustituciones de quien llama se "
"limitan a la política declarada de arrastres y valores manuales. El motor"
" de fórmulas emite observaciones tipadas con operandos, referencias "
"legales y de fuentes y una carga de reproducción de la capa del operador,"
" y después persiste una revisión BORRADOR direccionada por contenido y un"
" anclaje de datos contables. Las tablas de rutas del registro comprueban "
"que los resolvedores ejecutables estén inscritos una sola vez. Esto "
"produce un cálculo, no una exportación ni presentación. Preparación "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/_calculation_preparation.py`) "
"Encaminamiento de entradas "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/calculate_input.py`) Malla "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/calculation_actions.py`) Titularidad de "
"rutas (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/calculation_route.py`) "
"Persistencia de revisiones "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/revision_persistence.py`) "
"([067](../articles/067-modelo-calculation-preparation-edits-and-evidence-"
"gates.md), [070](../articles/070-modelo-calculation-input-and-"
"persistence-orchestration.md), [071](../articles/071-calculation-"
"findings-reports-and-pdf-verification.md), [082](../articles/082-review-"
"package-exchange-and-modelo-revision-persistence.md))"

#: ../../technical/topics/modelo-work-and-revision-lifecycle-part-1.md:26
msgid ""
"Input precedence is explicit: profile facts, source mesh, selected "
"Borrador 100 prefill, then admitted caller overrides. Profile binding "
"resolves date/enum/boolean/decimal channels under the pinned authority "
"and retains profile fingerprints; absent family or territory facts remain"
" unresolved. The Borrador route is opt-in by snapshot ID and accepts only"
" registry-marked AEAT-prefilled bindings. Work-review rows explain every "
"selected casilla's formula, realized source, provenance, blockers and "
"completeness role. Help cards render formula and dated parameters from "
"the same snapshot; they explain, but do not recalculate. Declarations "
"workspace/calendar project local and AEAT-evidence availability "
"separately, retaining stale/unreadable states and an unlinked AEAT "
"completion as distinct. Binding precedence "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/binding_resolution.py`) Profile binding "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/profile_binding.py`) Borrador selection "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/borrador_binding.py`) Work review "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/_work_review_assembly.py`) Calendar "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/declarations_calendar.py`) "
"([068](../articles/068-modelo-reconciliation-advisories-and-work-"
"projections.md), [069](../articles/069-aggregation-operations-amendments-"
"and-profile-bindings.md), [072](../articles/072-declaration-projections-"
"help-dependencies-and-edit-admission.md), [079](../articles/079-profile-"
"derived-bindings-and-filing-readiness.md))"
msgstr ""
"La precedencia de entradas es explícita: datos del perfil, malla de "
"fuentes, prerrelleno seleccionado de Borrador 100 y después sustituciones"
" admitidas de quien llama. La vinculación del perfil resuelve canales de "
"fecha, enumeración, booleanos y decimales bajo la autoridad fijada y "
"conserva huellas del perfil; los datos familiares o territoriales "
"ausentes siguen sin resolver. La ruta de Borrador se activa expresamente "
"por identificador de instantánea y solo acepta vinculaciones marcadas en "
"el registro como prerrellenadas por la AEAT. Las filas de revisión del "
"trabajo explican la fórmula, fuente realizada, procedencia, impedimentos "
"y función de integridad de cada casilla seleccionada. Las tarjetas de "
"ayuda representan fórmulas y parámetros fechados de la misma instantánea;"
" explican, pero no recalculan. El espacio y calendario de Declaraciones "
"proyectan por separado disponibilidad local y de evidencias de la AEAT, "
"conservando estados obsoletos e ilegibles y una finalización de la AEAT "
"no vinculada como distintos. Precedencia de vinculaciones "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/binding_resolution.py`) Vinculación del "
"perfil (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/profile_binding.py`) Selección de"
" Borrador (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/borrador_binding.py`) Revisión"
" del trabajo (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/_work_review_assembly.py`) "
"Calendario (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/declarations_calendar.py`) "
"([068](../articles/068-modelo-reconciliation-advisories-and-work-"
"projections.md), [069](../articles/069-aggregation-operations-amendments-"
"and-profile-bindings.md), [072](../articles/072-declaration-projections-"
"help-dependencies-and-edit-admission.md), [079](../articles/079-profile-"
"derived-bindings-and-filing-readiness.md))"

#: ../../technical/topics/modelo-work-and-revision-lifecycle-part-1.md:28
msgid ""
"Advisories name limits instead of fabricating values: "
"descendant/maternity and nursery evidence, M210 treaty conditions, "
"M303/M349 divergence, M720 redeclaration, capital-goods/prorrata "
"settlement and missing official boxes can produce diagnostics. Some are "
"nonblocking, while selected source issues persist as blocking revision "
"notes consumed later; other nonblocking notes are only process-local. "
"M202 has a stricter all-declared-bindings requirement. Modelo 123 with "
"captured withholding is explicitly blocked across calculate, verify, "
"local filing and export because its official rent-count unit is "
"unresolved. Modelo 193 settled prior-accrual rows likewise stop "
"filing/export where payment-year authority is absent, while remaining "
"inspectable at verification. Diagnostic collection "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/calculation_diagnostics.py`) Note gates "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/calculation_note_gate.py`) M202 gate "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/_required_binding_gate.py`) M123 refusal"
" (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/m123_count_authority_gate.py`) M193 "
"refusal (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/m193_settled_row_gate.py`) "
"([067](../articles/067-modelo-calculation-preparation-edits-and-evidence-"
"gates.md), [068](../articles/068-modelo-reconciliation-advisories-and-"
"work-projections.md), [071](../articles/071-calculation-findings-reports-"
"and-pdf-verification.md), [076](../articles/076-local-observations-m036"
"-records-and-m145-communications.md), [077](../articles/077-tax-evidence-"
"private-previews-and-spreadsheet-operations.md))"
msgstr ""
"Los avisos identifican límites en lugar de inventar valores: evidencias "
"de descendientes, maternidad y guardería, condiciones de convenios M210, "
"divergencias M303/M349, nueva declaración M720, liquidación de bienes de "
"inversión y prorrata y casillas oficiales ausentes pueden producir "
"diagnósticos. Algunos no bloquean, mientras que determinadas incidencias "
"de fuentes persisten como notas bloqueantes de revisión consumidas "
"después; otras notas no bloqueantes solo son locales al proceso. M202 "
"tiene un requisito más estricto de todas las vinculaciones declaradas. El"
" Modelo 123 con retenciones capturadas está expresamente bloqueado en "
"cálculo, verificación, presentación local y exportación porque su unidad "
"oficial de recuento de rentas no está resuelta. Las filas liquidadas de "
"devengos previos del Modelo 193 también detienen presentación y "
"exportación cuando falta autoridad del ejercicio de pago, aunque siguen "
"pudiendo inspeccionarse en verificación. Recogida de diagnósticos "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/calculation_diagnostics.py`) Controles "
"de notas (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/calculation_note_gate.py`) "
"Control M202 (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/_required_binding_gate.py`)"
" Rechazo M123 "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/m123_count_authority_gate.py`) Rechazo "
"M193 (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/m193_settled_row_gate.py`) "
"([067](../articles/067-modelo-calculation-preparation-edits-and-evidence-"
"gates.md), [068](../articles/068-modelo-reconciliation-advisories-and-"
"work-projections.md), [071](../articles/071-calculation-findings-reports-"
"and-pdf-verification.md), [076](../articles/076-local-observations-m036"
"-records-and-m145-communications.md), [077](../articles/077-tax-evidence-"
"private-previews-and-spreadsheet-operations.md))"

#: ../../technical/topics/modelo-work-and-revision-lifecycle-part-1.md:30
msgid ""
"Editing uses a short-lived, value-free compare-and-swap baseline over the"
" current work and revision head plus writable registry surface. Localized"
" parsing rejects ambiguous numbers and validates NIF/IBAN, and preflight "
"gives addressable feedback. Execution rechecks the head and source "
"ownership before replaying operator values through canonical calculation."
" The active executor supports scalar and binding changes but explicitly "
"rejects row intents and recalculation-only families despite data "
"structures for them. The ordinary registered calculation can replay only "
"the current operator layer, avoiding promotion of profile/ledger values "
"into caller overrides; an explicit request uses its own inputs. Admission"
" baseline (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/edit_admission.py`) Edit "
"execution (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/_edit_execution.py`) Parse "
"grammar (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/edit_number_parsing.py`) Replay "
"mode (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/operation_definitions.py`) "
"([067](../articles/067-modelo-calculation-preparation-edits-and-evidence-"
"gates.md), [072](../articles/072-declaration-projections-help-"
"dependencies-and-edit-admission.md), [073](../articles/073-edit-value-"
"contracts-and-modelo-export.md), [078](../articles/078-supervised-filing-"
"lifecycle-and-operation-contracts.md))"
msgstr ""
"La edición utiliza una base de comparación e intercambio de corta "
"duración y sin valores sobre el trabajo y la cabecera de revisión "
"actuales más la superficie escribible del registro. El análisis "
"localizado rechaza números ambiguos y valida NIF e IBAN, y la "
"comprobación previa proporciona comentarios localizables. La ejecución "
"vuelve a comprobar cabecera y titularidad de fuentes antes de reproducir "
"valores del operador mediante cálculo canónico. El ejecutor activo admite"
" cambios escalares y de vinculaciones, pero rechaza expresamente "
"intenciones de filas y familias de solo recálculo pese a disponer de "
"estructuras de datos para ellas. El cálculo registrado ordinario solo "
"puede reproducir la capa actual del operador, evitando promover valores "
"del perfil o libro contable a sustituciones de quien llama; una solicitud"
" explícita utiliza sus propias entradas. Base de admisión "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/edit_admission.py`) Ejecución de "
"ediciones (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/_edit_execution.py`) Gramática"
" de análisis (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/edit_number_parsing.py`) "
"Modo de reproducción "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/operation_definitions.py`) "
"([067](../articles/067-modelo-calculation-preparation-edits-and-evidence-"
"gates.md), [072](../articles/072-declaration-projections-help-"
"dependencies-and-edit-admission.md), [073](../articles/073-edit-value-"
"contracts-and-modelo-export.md), [078](../articles/078-supervised-filing-"
"lifecycle-and-operation-contracts.md))"

#: ../../technical/topics/modelo-work-and-revision-lifecycle-part-1.md:32
msgid "Verification, artifacts, and filing authority"
msgstr "Verificación, artefactos y autoridad de presentación"

#: ../../technical/topics/modelo-work-and-revision-lifecycle-part-1.md:34
msgid ""
"Verification rechecks current work/revision, law-selected filing-grade "
"authority, required manual inputs, row templates, model-specific "
"predicates, source evidence, IVA wallet, cross-period conditions and "
"ledger drift. For a granting report, it stamps the revision verified and "
"co-writes the transaction participation index. Refused attempts also "
"receive a report. A saved granting report and later revision transition "
"are separate repository steps, so interruption recovery needs "
"verification. Selection prefers the current filed revision, then current "
"verified revision; a current draft prevents silent fallback to an older "
"result. Verification gate "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/verification_actions.py`) Grant and "
"participation (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/verification_actions.py`) "
"Selection (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/selectors.py`) "
"([083](../articles/083-revision-selection-settlement-presentation-and-"
"verification.md))"
msgstr ""
"La verificación vuelve a comprobar trabajo y revisión actuales, autoridad"
" apta para declaración seleccionada según la ley, entradas manuales "
"obligatorias, plantillas de filas, predicados específicos del modelo, "
"evidencias de origen, cartera de IVA, condiciones entre períodos y "
"divergencias contables. Para un informe favorable, marca la revisión como"
" verificada y escribe conjuntamente el índice de participación de "
"transacciones. Los intentos rechazados también reciben un informe. Un "
"informe favorable guardado y la transición posterior de revisión son "
"pasos separados de repositorio, por lo que debe verificarse la "
"recuperación ante interrupciones. La selección prefiere la revisión "
"presentada actual y después la verificada actual; un borrador actual "
"impide recurrir silenciosamente a un resultado anterior. Control de "
"verificación (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/verification_actions.py`) "
"Aprobación y participación "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/verification_actions.py`) Selección "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/selectors.py`) ([083](../articles/083"
"-revision-selection-settlement-presentation-and-verification.md))"

#: ../../technical/topics/modelo-work-and-revision-lifecycle-part-1.md:36
msgid ""
"Local export replays the sealed revision into an approved filing draft, "
"rebuilds model producer facts and applies schema, profile, ledger, cross-"
"period and special-model gates before selecting the official layout. It "
"stages a BOE artifact beside the chosen destination, appends an export "
"event, publishes bytes and verifies the landed size/digest. A publication"
" failure after the event could leave history for a file that never "
"appeared; this is a sequencing risk to test. Calculation-report CSV/PDF "
"is a different local artifact: the canonical report carries provenance "
"and its PDF can receive a domain-separated Ed25519 signature with "
"`aeat_official=false`. Document-only validation yields `valid_unpinned`; "
"profile-store verification pins the key and rebuilds the report. Neither "
"artifact is AEAT acceptance. Spreadsheet export/pull/verify is another "
"supervised surface and remote parity work can modify Google Sheets; the "
"workbook plan and registered effect accounting do not make it an official"
" filing. Modelo export (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/export.py`) "
"Export sink (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/export_sink.py`) Report "
"signature "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/calculation_report_certification.py`) "
"Report verification "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/calculation_report_verification.py`) "
"Spreadsheet executor "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/modelo_spreadsheet_executor.py`) "
"([071](../articles/071-calculation-findings-reports-and-pdf-"
"verification.md), [073](../articles/073-edit-value-contracts-and-modelo-"
"export.md), [077](../articles/077-tax-evidence-private-previews-and-"
"spreadsheet-operations.md), [078](../articles/078-supervised-filing-"
"lifecycle-and-operation-contracts.md))"
msgstr ""
"La exportación local reproduce la revisión sellada en un borrador "
"aprobado, reconstruye datos de productor del modelo y aplica controles de"
" esquema, perfil, libro contable, condiciones entre períodos y modelos "
"especiales antes de seleccionar el diseño oficial. Prepara un artefacto "
"BOE junto al destino elegido, añade un evento de exportación, publica "
"bytes y verifica tamaño y resumen del archivo publicado. Un fallo de "
"publicación tras el evento podría dejar historial de un archivo que nunca"
" apareció; es un riesgo de secuencia que debe probarse. El CSV o PDF de "
"informe de cálculo es un artefacto local distinto: el informe canónico "
"contiene procedencia y su PDF puede recibir una firma Ed25519 con "
"separación de dominio y `aeat_official=false`. La validación solo del "
"documento produce `valid_unpinned`; la verificación con el almacén del "
"perfil fija la clave y reconstruye el informe. Ningún artefacto es "
"aceptación de la AEAT. La exportación, obtención y verificación de hojas "
"de cálculo es otra superficie supervisada y el trabajo remoto de "
"correspondencia puede modificar Google Sheets; el plan del libro y la "
"contabilización registrada de efectos no lo convierten en una "
"presentación oficial. Exportación de modelos "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/export.py`) Destino de exportación "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/export_sink.py`) Firma de informes "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/calculation_report_certification.py`) "
"Verificación de informes "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/calculation_report_verification.py`) "
"Ejecutor de hojas de cálculo "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/modelo_spreadsheet_executor.py`) "
"([071](../articles/071-calculation-findings-reports-and-pdf-"
"verification.md), [073](../articles/073-edit-value-contracts-and-modelo-"
"export.md), [077](../articles/077-tax-evidence-private-previews-and-"
"spreadsheet-operations.md), [078](../articles/078-supervised-filing-"
"lifecycle-and-operation-contracts.md))"

#: ../../technical/topics/modelo-work-and-revision-lifecycle-part-1.md:38
msgid ""
"Local filing requires the exact verification report and rechecks "
"readiness and evidence. It persists a PRESENTADO revision with a filing "
"record whose AEAT status is PENDIENTE, co-writing pointers, "
"participation, events and app-filing observations. Such local "
"observations can inform future calculations but remain nonofficial for "
"dependent filing gates. External import instead needs registry-grounded "
"values and receipt/register evidence matching model, period and taxpayer;"
" reconciliation promotes a pending chain only on comparable matching "
"evidence, otherwise records discrepancy or unverifiable status. An "
"amendment starts only from a current AEAT-confirmed, externally evidenced"
" filing baseline, creates a new local pending correction and still "
"requires external confirmation later. Local filing transition "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/revision_persistence.py`) External "
"import (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/external_import_actions.py`) "
"Reconciliation "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/filing_chain_reconciliation.py`) "
"Amendment (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/amendment_actions.py`) "
"([069](../articles/069-aggregation-operations-amendments-and-profile-"
"bindings.md), [074](../articles/074-external-filing-evidence-local-"
"filing-and-filing-views.md), [082](../articles/082-review-package-"
"exchange-and-modelo-revision-persistence.md))"
msgstr ""
"La presentación local exige el informe exacto de verificación y vuelve a "
"comprobar preparación y evidencias. Persiste una revisión PRESENTADO con "
"un registro cuyo estado ante la AEAT es PENDIENTE, escribiendo "
"conjuntamente punteros, participación, eventos y observaciones de "
"presentación de la aplicación. Estas observaciones locales pueden "
"informar cálculos futuros, pero siguen siendo no oficiales para controles"
" de presentación dependientes. La importación externa, en cambio, "
"necesita valores fundamentados en el registro y evidencias de "
"justificantes o registros coincidentes con modelo, período y "
"contribuyente; la conciliación solo promueve una cadena pendiente ante "
"evidencias comparables coincidentes y, en otro caso, registra "
"discrepancia o estado no verificable. Una rectificación solo empieza "
"desde una base actual de presentación confirmada por la AEAT y respaldada"
" externamente, crea una nueva corrección local pendiente y sigue "
"requiriendo confirmación externa posterior. Transición de presentación "
"local (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/revision_persistence.py`) "
"Importación externa "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/external_import_actions.py`) "
"Conciliación "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/filing_chain_reconciliation.py`) "
"Rectificación (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/amendment_actions.py`) "
"([069](../articles/069-aggregation-operations-amendments-and-profile-"
"bindings.md), [074](../articles/074-external-filing-evidence-local-"
"filing-and-filing-views.md), [082](../articles/082-review-package-"
"exchange-and-modelo-revision-persistence.md))"

#: ../../technical/topics/modelo-work-and-revision-lifecycle-part-1.md:40
msgid ""
"The M303 wallet gate specifically distinguishes a missing prior "
"observation from an unreadable or unusable one. First-period zero needs "
"governed zero or activity-start evidence; an operator override remains an"
" assertion and can stay sticky after later evidence arrives. Prior-"
"domiciliation cancellation requires a rectificativa linked to an AEAT-"
"accepted same-period record, matching official observation, justificante "
"CSV, and exact declaration header. Operator-manual observation overlays "
"and M036 records are explicitly local assertions; M145 is a payer "
"communication with local export/delivery, and its ownership contract "
"refuses AEAT filing or receipt semantics. Wallet gate "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/iva_wallet_gate.py`) Domiciliation "
"evidence (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/prior_domiciliation.py`) Local "
"observations "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/local_observation_actions.py`) M036 "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/m036_lifecycle.py`) M145 ownership "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/m145_communication.py`) "
"([075](../articles/075-modelo-history-invoice-withholding-capture-and-"
"iva-wallet.md), [076](../articles/076-local-observations-m036-records-"
"and-m145-communications.md), [077](../articles/077-tax-evidence-private-"
"previews-and-spreadsheet-operations.md), [079](../articles/079-profile-"
"derived-bindings-and-filing-readiness.md))"
msgstr ""
"El control de cartera M303 distingue específicamente una observación "
"previa ausente de una ilegible o inutilizable. El cero del primer período"
" necesita cero gobernado o evidencias de inicio de actividad; una "
"sustitución del operador sigue siendo una afirmación y puede persistir "
"tras llegar evidencias posteriores. La cancelación de domiciliación "
"previa exige una rectificativa vinculada a un registro del mismo período "
"aceptado por la AEAT, observación oficial coincidente, CSV del "
"justificante y encabezado exacto de declaración. Las capas de "
"observaciones manuales del operador y los registros M036 son expresamente"
" afirmaciones locales; M145 es una comunicación al pagador con "
"exportación y entrega locales, y su contrato de titularidad rechaza "
"semántica de presentación o justificante de la AEAT. Control de cartera "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/iva_wallet_gate.py`) Evidencias de "
"domiciliación (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/prior_domiciliation.py`) "
"Observaciones locales "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/local_observation_actions.py`) M036 "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/m036_lifecycle.py`) Titularidad M145 "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/m145_communication.py`) "
"([075](../articles/075-modelo-history-invoice-withholding-capture-and-"
"iva-wallet.md), [076](../articles/076-local-observations-m036-records-"
"and-m145-communications.md), [077](../articles/077-tax-evidence-private-"
"previews-and-spreadsheet-operations.md), [079](../articles/079-profile-"
"derived-bindings-and-filing-readiness.md))"

#: ../../technical/topics/modelo-work-and-revision-lifecycle-part-1.md:42
msgid "Review collaboration and assessment"
msgstr "Colaboración en revisión y evaluación"

#: ../../technical/topics/modelo-work-and-revision-lifecycle-part-1.md:44
msgid ""
"A verified or filed revision can become an accountant review-package ZIP "
"containing the rendered artifact and calculation evidence. Checksums "
"protect member integrity; Ed25519 signatures are verified against "
"independently supplied trusted keys, and recipient encryption uses a "
"registered public key fingerprint for out-of-band checking. Plain ZIPs "
"and decrypted output remain operator-chosen local files. Recipient "
"registry changes are written before separate audit events, so partial "
"effect is possible. Feedback import does not visibly consume the replay "
"nonce that the direct decrypt route consumes; whether an adapter does so "
"elsewhere remains open. Package build "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/review_package.py`) Signature "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/review_package_signing.py`) Recipient "
"registry "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/review_package_recipient_registry.py`) "
"Feedback replay path "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/review_package_exchange_operation.py`) "
"([081](../articles/081-reconciliation-filing-disposition-and-accountant-"
"review-packages.md), [082](../articles/082-review-package-exchange-and-"
"modelo-revision-persistence.md))"
msgstr ""
"Una revisión verificada o presentada puede convertirse en un ZIP de "
"revisión para un contable con el artefacto generado y evidencias de "
"cálculo. Las sumas de comprobación protegen la integridad de miembros; "
"las firmas Ed25519 se verifican frente a claves fiables suministradas "
"independientemente, y el cifrado del destinatario utiliza una huella "
"registrada de clave pública para comprobarla por otro canal. Los ZIP sin "
"cifrar y las salidas descifradas siguen siendo archivos locales elegidos "
"por el operador. Los cambios del registro de destinatarios se escriben "
"antes de eventos separados de auditoría, por lo que puede haber efecto "
"parcial. La importación de comentarios no consume visiblemente el nonce "
"de repetición que consume la ruta directa de descifrado; sigue abierto si"
" un adaptador lo hace en otra parte. Construcción del paquete "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/review_package.py`) Firma "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/review_package_signing.py`) Registro de "
"destinatarios "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/review_package_recipient_registry.py`) "
"Ruta de repetición de comentarios "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/review_package_exchange_operation.py`) "
"([081](../articles/081-reconciliation-filing-disposition-and-accountant-"
"review-packages.md), [082](../articles/082-review-package-exchange-and-"
"modelo-revision-persistence.md))"

#: ../../technical/topics/modelo-work-and-revision-lifecycle-part-1.md:46
msgid ""
"Quickfile sequences readiness, work creation/resume, calculation, "
"verification and local export with stage-specific stop/partial effect "
"accounting; it never submits. M100-from-M130 projection is an ephemeral "
"estimate using latest cumulative quarter values and an explicit early-"
"year extrapolation, not a filed M100. Reconciliation of local PDFs is "
"enrolled only for selected Modelos and reports missing amount anchors "
"instead of overstating an identity match. Quickfile "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/quickfile.py`) M100 projection "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/projection.py`) PDF reconciliation "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/reconciliation.py`) "
"([080](../articles/080-modelo-projections-queries-quickfile-and-"
"recipient-encryption.md), [081](../articles/081-reconciliation-filing-"
"disposition-and-accountant-review-packages.md))"
msgstr ""
"Quickfile encadena preparación, creación o reanudación del trabajo, "
"cálculo, verificación y exportación local con contabilización de paradas "
"y efectos parciales específica de cada etapa; nunca presenta. La "
"proyección de M100 desde M130 es una estimación efímera que utiliza los "
"últimos valores trimestrales acumulados y una extrapolación explícita a "
"comienzos del ejercicio, no un M100 presentado. La conciliación de PDF "
"locales solo está inscrita para modelos seleccionados e informa de "
"anclajes de importes ausentes en lugar de exagerar una coincidencia de "
"identidad. Quickfile (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/quickfile.py`) "
"Proyección M100 (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/projection.py`) "
"Conciliación PDF (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/reconciliation.py`) "
"([080](../articles/080-modelo-projections-queries-quickfile-and-"
"recipient-encryption.md), [081](../articles/081-reconciliation-filing-"
"disposition-and-accountant-review-packages.md))"

#: ../../technical/topics/modelo-work-and-revision-lifecycle-part-1.md:48
msgid ""
"The main strengths are pinned registry coordinates, separated source and "
"operator layers, typed provenance, blocked unsupported paths, exact-"
"profile operation admission, and explicit local-versus-official evidence."
" Scoped verification priorities are the error-after-persistence ordering "
"in calculation, cross-store verification/export recovery, authority "
"helpers that reopen bundled generations, wallet override freshness, "
"recipient feedback replay, and display of process-local advisories. No "
"runtime or legal accuracy claim follows from this static review. Post-"
"persist advisories "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/calculation_actions.py`) Verification "
"persistence (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/verification_actions.py`) "
"Wallet override (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/iva_wallet_gate.py`) "
"([070](../articles/070-modelo-calculation-input-and-persistence-"
"orchestration.md), [075](../articles/075-modelo-history-invoice-"
"withholding-capture-and-iva-wallet.md), [083](../articles/083-revision-"
"selection-settlement-presentation-and-verification.md))"
msgstr ""
"Las principales fortalezas son coordenadas fijadas del registro, capas "
"separadas de fuentes y operador, procedencia tipada, bloqueo de rutas no "
"admitidas, admisión de operaciones del perfil exacto y distinción "
"explícita de evidencias locales y oficiales. Las prioridades acotadas de "
"verificación son el orden de errores después de persistir en cálculo, la "
"recuperación de verificación y exportación entre almacenes, las "
"utilidades de autoridad que reabren generaciones incluidas, la vigencia "
"de sustituciones de cartera, la repetición de comentarios de "
"destinatarios y la visualización de avisos locales al proceso. De esta "
"revisión estática no se deriva ninguna afirmación de exactitud en "
"ejecución o jurídica. Avisos posteriores a persistencia "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/calculation_actions.py`) Persistencia de"
" verificación (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/verification_actions.py`) "
"Sustitución de cartera "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/iva_wallet_gate.py`) "
"([070](../articles/070-modelo-calculation-input-and-persistence-"
"orchestration.md), [075](../articles/075-modelo-history-invoice-"
"withholding-capture-and-iva-wallet.md), [083](../articles/083-revision-"
"selection-settlement-presentation-and-verification.md))"

